                    <div class=3D"component-widge" tabindex=3D"0">
                    <!--?lit$543615907$--><p>To get started with programmin=
g, you don't have to install anything. If you're reading this, you (most li=
kely) have a working Internet browser and an active Internet connection. Th=
is means that you can use one of the sites below and start programming imme=
diately =E2=80=93 just like that.</p>

<h2>Ideone</h2>
<p>The first one is named <b>ideone</b> available at <a href=3D"http://ideo=
ne.com/" title=3D"http://ideone.com" target=3D"_blank" style=3D"color: #00b=
ceb;">http://ideone.com</a>. Although you don=E2=80=99t need to register to=
 start your work, we suggest that you do =E2=80=93 it=E2=80=99ll enable som=
e additional, valuable features.</p>

<p>Signing up is easy =E2=80=93 certainly not more difficult than the regis=
tration on the S4A website. You can also use your Facebook account to sign =
into ideone =E2=80=93 it=E2=80=99ll make the whole process even faster and =
more convenient.</p>

<p>After signing in, you=E2=80=99ll have to do some customizing, and two th=
ings are essential: change your default programming language to "C++" (don'=
t forget to do that) and then enable syntax highlighting =E2=80=93 it=E2=80=
=99ll make it easier to do your work.</p>

<p>To test the Ideone environment, go to the "new code" tab and just copy-a=
nd-paste the text in the editor.</p>
<br>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                </div>=20
            </div></template></raw-html><!---->
